  "description": "Enjoy a relaxed lifestyle in this well-presented 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom apartment, ideally positioned within a secure riverside complex with resort-style amenities including a pool, tennis court and gazebo.<br/><br/>Located on the first floor, the apartment features light-filled open plan living, a private balcony overlooking the pool and gardens, a functional kitchen with ample storage, and two generously sized bedrooms with built-in robes.<br/><br/>Perfectly situated just moments from the South Perth foreshore, cafes, restaurants and public transport, this home offers lifestyle and convenience in one of Perth's most desirable suburbs.<br/><br/>*Please note this is a 6 month lease only* <br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>2 bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>1 bathroom<br/>Open plan living and dining area<br/>Private balcony with pool and garden outlook<br/>Split system air conditioning to master bedroom and lounge<br/>Ceiling fans in both bedrooms<br/>Internal laundry<br/>Undercover carport for one vehicle<br/>Secure gated complex<br/>Pool, tennis court and gazebo facilities<br/><br/>Location Highlights:<br/>Walking distance to the South Perth foreshore<br/>Close to cafes, restaurants and local shopping<br/>Easy access to Perth CBD<br/>Nearby public transport options<br/>Enjoy scenic river walkways and parklands nearby<br/><br/>PLEASE DRIVE BY THE PROPERTY TO ASSESS ITS SUITABILITY.<br/><br/>WANTING TO VIEW THIS HOME?<br/>To view this property please register for an inspection time via the Driven Property Group website https://www.drivengroup.com.au<br/><br/>Click on \"Book Inspection\" and follow the prompts. If there are no available or suitable times, use the contact agent' submission form to request an inspection, you will then be notified of the next scheduled viewing. <br/><br/>Applications are submitted through 2 apply and the link will be sent once the property has been viewed.",
